        "sender_full_name": "Osman Yasar",
        "timestamp": 1782343674
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>No, every theorem I used is available in recent lean version or already proven in the previous snippet. It's just that the proof is not in the ideal shape as some lemmas about hashsets were missing and I (ab?)used the hashmap -hashset relation.</p>",
        "id": 606411879,
        "sender_full_name": "Johannes Tantow",
        "timestamp": 1782371343
