    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"619540\">Johannes Tantow</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/toList.20of.20HashMap.2Eerase/near/606411879\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>No, every theorem I used is available in recent lean version or already proven in the previous snippet. It's just that the proof is not in the ideal shape as some lemmas about hashsets were missing and I (ab?)used the hashmap -hashset relation.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I see, I could not get this proof working, specifically because of the <code>List.Perm.of_nodup_of_nodup_of_forall_mem_iff_mem</code>. I am getting the error \"Unknown constant\", and I also could not find this in Loogle. Is this normal/am I missing some imports?</p>",
